{
  "key": 18227,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "This is my trusted pal, POLIWRATH.\r",
        "I wonder if it will become a Frog\n",
        "Pokémon someday."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00001",
      "en_US": "POLIWRATH: Poli poli!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, my!\n",
        "Were you staring at me?\r",
        "Seeing me come out of the Game Corner\n",
        "with a whole pile of Coins...\f",
        "And grinning to myself?\f",
        "You were, weren’t you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "GRIMER started to appear recently.\n",
        "You see the pond in front of the house?\r",
        "It has GRIMER, too.\n",
        "I wonder where they came from.\r",
        "Sigh..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Ha ha! This Gym is great!\n",
        "It’s full of strong Trainers!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll tell you a secret!\r",
        "The Celadon Condominiums have some\n",
        "places you can only reach by taking the\f",
        "elevator on the second floor!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "The restaurant there is having an\n",
        "eating contest.\r",
        "I heard that we have a great\n",
        "contestant from the Sinnoh region\f",
        "this year."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "The Celadon Department Store offers\n",
        "the widest range of items!\f",
        "You can buy anything you want!\r",
        "...Do I sound like their\n",
        "sales representative?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "I love this kind of place where\n",
        "there are many buildings!\r",
        "I heard Johto also has a city called\n",
        "Goldenrod that has many\f",
        "tall buildings.\f",
        "I would love to visit there sometime."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Hi, Jasmine. I heard Whitney from\n",
        "Goldenrod Gym said you were too\f",
        "plain and should look more fancy.\f",
        "Is that true?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Yes...\r",
        "I’m thinking maybe I should\n",
        "participate in this Contest in Sinnoh\f",
        "to try and be more vibrant...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00011",
      "en_US": "Erika: How did it go?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: I couldn’t bring myself to\n",
        "go to the Contest.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, I see...\r",
        "Then why don’t you try putting on\n",
        "something especially gorgeous?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Ah, yes!\n",
        "Maybe I can bring myself to\f",
        "enter the Contest!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: How about a fancy, light blue\n",
        "outfit with a cape over it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: What?\n",
        "That’s too embarrassing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: I see.\n",
        "You think Clair from Blackthorn is a\f",
        "little embarrassing...\f",
        "I’m just taking notes.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Oh, no!\n",
        "Erika, that’s not what I meant!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Would you like to\n",
        "exchange numbers? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Erika\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: I am often free in the morning\n",
        "on Sunday.\r",
        "Call me around then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00022",
      "en_US": "Erika: Oh, that’s too bad..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Would you like to\n",
        "exchange numbers? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Hi!\n",
        "Good to see you here.\r",
        "How would you like to take a picture\n",
        "with me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00025",
      "en_US": "Erika: Try and look cool now.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Good job.\n",
        "It looks good!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00027",
      "en_US": "Erika: Oh, that’s too bad..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC and delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00029",
      "en_US": "Jasmine: Amphy is well thanks to you."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Celadon City\n",
        "City of the Rainbow’s Colors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Celadon City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Erika\f",
        "The Nature-Loving Princess!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Find what you need at the\n",
        "Celadon Dept. Store!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00033",
      "en_US": "Celadon Condominiums"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "Celadon Game Corner\n",
        "A Fun Place for Everyone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0491_T07_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Guard Spec. protects Pokémon\n",
        "from status-reduction moves\f",
        "during battle.\r",
        "Get your items at the\n",
        "Celadon Dept. Store!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
